body:
Could worth it to make a generic merge function to reduce duplication and save on bundle size. WDYT?
```js
type GenericMerger = (
  key: keyof SearchParameters,
  right: SearchParameters
) => Merge;

const mergeGeneric: GenericMerger = (key, right) => left =>
  left.setQueryParameters({
    [key]: {
      ...left[key],
      ...right[key],
    },
  });

// ...

compose(
  mergeGeneric('hierarchicalFacetsRefinements', right),
  mergeGeneric('numericRefinements', right),
  // ...
)(left)
```

